    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35963" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνορκ-ίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make</i> one
				<i>swear,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὶ ποιεῖν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(5).697.4
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Syros</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ.
				τινὶ ὅρκον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9(1).643
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cephallenia</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				8.15.4
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνωρκήσατο</span>
			):—later in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνορκίζω ὑμᾶς τὸν κύριον
					ἀναγνωσθῆναι τὴν ἐπιστολήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Thess.</u>
					5.27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὑμῖν τὸν βασιλέα τῶν δαιμόνων</span>”
				<i>Tab. Defix.Aud.</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					26.15
				</span></i>
			 (Cyprus, <span class="entity">iii A. D.</span>).</div>
